ose above the base high of $37.66. Volume that day was 2.0M shares, 1.64x the prior 10-day average of 1.2M. It didn't hold. By Mar 29, 2012 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $28.72.","lesson":"This is an example of a failed breakout where everything looked right, volume included, and the stock fell back anyway. It happens. This is why traders cut losses fast instead of hoping."}}